    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_headline">No data collected. Molkky Board never connects to the Internet.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_no_ads">Molkky Board contains no ads, no ad trackers, no audience measurement tools, and sells no data.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_local">When several phones play together, they talk directly to each other, encrypted, on the local network. Nothing else leaves your phone unless you choose to share it.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_control">You can back up, export or delete your data at any time, in Settings › Data.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_open_source">Built with open source libraries (list below).</string>
