    <string name="credits_thanks_title">Thanks</string>
    <string name="credits_thanks_players">To the players who said “that was 7, not 8”: “Correct a throw” exists thanks to you.</string>
    <string name="credits_thanks_pin12">To pin no. 12, always in the middle, always aimed at, rarely hit alone.</string>
    <string name="credits_outro">No pins were harmed in the making of this app. They all flew away of their own free will.</string>
    <string name="credits_post_credits">Post-credits scene: ✨ … somewhere, far in the back of the screen, a pin is still twinkling.</string>
